.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-container-sizes - Serverless container sizes (vCPU / memory pairs) and prices


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro container sizes [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Serverless container sizes (vCPU / memory pairs) and prices

.PP
Gyro Containers Serverless bills each running container copy per hour: \fBcpu_m/1000\fR x vCPU-hour + \fBmemory_mi/1024\fR x GB-hour, from the prepaid balance, no monthly cap. Only the \fBcpu_m\fR / \fBmemory_mi\fR pairs listed here are accepted on \fBPOST /cloud/containers/{id}/services\fR of a serverless environment (422 \fBinvalid_cpu\fR / \fBinvalid_memory\fR). 404 \fBserverless_not_available\fR when the product is not offered.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/billing/container-sizes (operationId getContainerSizes, scope billing_read)


